const readmeFile=path.join(here,'products/rea-studio/apps/editor/README.md'),readme=await fs.readFile(readmeFile,'utf8');await fs.writeFile(readmeFile,readme+'\nA pending save captures one file revision and one text snapshot. Typing remains available; a completed write updates the saved baseline and revision while retaining any newer draft. Duplicate saves for that open document wait until its pending request settles. Late responses cannot update a disposed view, a closed/reopened tab, or the status of another active document. Server-side direct calls capture the declared revision before entering the save queue; changing the caller object while queued does not change that precondition.\n');
